eld (21.1.8+gxr2~26.04.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Package ELD 21.1.8 for Ubuntu 26.04 using the system LLVM 21 toolchain.
  * Enable the Hexagon, AArch64, ARM, RISC-V, and x86-64 linker backends.
  * Include the linker plugin development API and YAML map utility.
  * Add the split Polly development package required by LLVM's CMake exports.

